1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,880
Qu'est-ce que tu aimes faire ?
What do you like to do?

2
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:05,924
J'aime beaucoup dessiner.
I really like drawing.

3
00:00:06,424 --> 00:00:10,384
C'est génial ! Tu aimes le sport ?
That's awesome! Do you like sports?

4
00:00:10,884 --> 00:00:13,956
Oui, j'aime jouer au tennis.
Yes, I like playing tennis.

5
00:00:14,456 --> 00:00:17,960
Moi, j'adore écouter de la musique.
I love listening to music.

6
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:20,764
Quel genre de musique ?
What kind of music?

7
00:00:21,264 --> 00:00:23,808
J'aime la pop et le rock.
I like pop and rock.

8
00:00:24,308 --> 00:00:26,996
On a beaucoup de choses en commun !
We have a lot in common!

9
00:00:27,496 --> 00:00:32,008
Oui ! On devrait faire quelque chose ensemble !
Yes! We should do something together!

